Description: Provides tools for the analysis of long non-coding RNA regulation
    in single-cell transcriptomic data. LANCE supports data import and
    preprocessing, construction of Seurat-based analysis objects, estimation
    of gene expression specificity, and generation of pseudobulk expression
    profiles. The package enables the reconstruction and exploration of
    lncRNA-centered gene regulatory networks by integrating co-expression and
    regulatory relationships, with particular emphasis on cell-type-specific
    analyses and reusable workflows across biological datasets.
